          "code": "EXTRACTACCPARTYNUMFROMCONTEXT",
          "id": "1774642620847",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774642620849_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Extract the PartyNumber from the available inputs below.\n\n  Primary inputs:\n  - User message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n  - Workflow context: {{$context.$nodes.GETCONTEXT.$output.result}}\n\n  Rules:\n  1. FIRST, check whether the user message contains an account number or party number such as ORCL-0001 or another explicit identifier.\n  2. If not found in the user message, then extract PartyNumber from \"$system.$inputContext\" if available.\n  3. If still not found, then search across the complete context (all available fields and text).\n  4. Ensure accurate extraction even if PartyNumber appears nested or embedded within text.\n  5. Return only the identifier value itself.\n\n  Output Requirements:\n  - Return ONLY the PartyNumber value.\n  - Do NOT include any extra text, labels, JSON, or explanation.\n  - If no PartyNumber is found, return an empty string."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "PrepareMessage",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let inputMessage = $context.$system.$inputMessage;\nlet accountPartyNumber = $context.$variables.accountPartyNumber;\nlet accountPartyId = $context.$variables.accountPartyId;\nlet accountName = $context.$variables.accountName;\nlet ultimateParentId = $context.$variables.ultimatePartyId;\nlet ultimateParentNumber = $context.$variables.ultimatePartyNumber;\n\nlet parts = [];\n\nif (inputMessage != null && inputMessage !== \"\") {\n  parts.push(\"UserQuestion=\" + inputMessage);\n}\nif (accountName != null && accountName !== \"\") {\n  parts.push(\"AccountName=\" + accountName);\n}\nif (accountPartyNumber != null && accountPartyNumber !== \"\") {\n  parts.push(\"AccountPartyNumber=\" + accountPartyNumber);\n}\nif (accountPartyId != null && accountPartyId !== \"\") {\n  parts.push(\"AccountPartyId=\" + accountPartyId);\n}\nif (ultimateParentId != null && ultimateParentId !== \"\") {\n  parts.push(\"UltimateParentAccountPartyId=\" + ultimateParentId);\n}\nif (ultimateParentNumber != null && ultimateParentNumber !== \"\") {\n  parts.push(\"UltimateParentAccountPartyNumber=\" + ultimateParentNumber);\n}\n\nlet result = parts.join(\", \" );\nresult;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1774249494684"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 8420.373618788344,
            "y": 6768.112188490238
          },
